  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Monthly Meetings</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5752 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-news category-zoom tag-larry-folding tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5752\">\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-demo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding Demo</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-dfd2582e14930d4b2c34/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Video</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-05-01T07:57:38-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, May 1, 2021, 7:57 am\">May 1, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5734\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6b9a0f8c5f6130988f7ec84e1e2c687ecfcbed898826363f24ba86889e0585.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Larry Folding gave a tour of his Harwich studio and a 1/2 hour watercolor demonstration at the April 24th General Meeting. View the meeting here using the access passcode <b>LarryFolding@421<br />\n</b></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Meeting Recording:<b><br />\n<a href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/share/MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJasLnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/<wbr></wbr>share/<wbr></wbr>MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-<wbr></wbr>1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJas<wbr></wbr>LnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca</a></b></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-5640 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-chris-banks tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5640\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/chris-banks-demonstrates-on-zoom/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"415\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting tools on a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/1937045ed9a9793d38619dd92b860b355c2a6c2f7e857775197efaf934e0b279.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/chris-banks-demonstrates-on-zoom/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Chris Banks Demonstrates on Zoom!</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-02-17T18:25:27-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, February 17, 2021, 6:25 pm\">February 17, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists will host Cape Cod artist and former Guild President Chris Banks virtually via Zoom on February 20, 2021, after the members’ meeting at 2:00 p.m. Banks will discuss tips and techniques for painting in oils on a black surface.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4077 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-monthly-meetings tag-steve-kennedy\" id=\"post-4077\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/steve-kennedy-demonstrates/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"390\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of houses by the water.\" src=\"/media/archive/bab0dca7335b2f0b43412cb5aea59ba2f62ac5eaf0ba4026d7d8f957686d8648.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/steve-kennedy-demonstrates/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Steve Kennedy Demonstrates</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-01-06T15:42:53-05:00\" title=\"Sunday, January 6, 2019, 3:42 pm\">January 6, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Member Meeting – Saturday, January 19, 2019, 2:00p.m., Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich. Award winning artist, Steve Kennedy, will give an oil painting demonstration at the Guild of Harwich <a href=\"/news/steve-kennedy-demonstrates/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3768 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-fee-e-demonstration tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-ma tag-monthly-meetings\" id=\"post-3768\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-monthly-meeting/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman standing in front of easels with paintings on them.\" src=\"/media/archive/5cd6846c51bb8cf0b7ffb6794f5839847ba370398c13fc1e1e12193bbcc427db.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-monthly-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Monthly Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-07T00:54:21-04:00\" title=\"Monday, May 7, 2018, 12:54 am\">May 7, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Presentation by Angela Zoni Mault, Executive Director of Creative Arts Center in Chatham. This will be a critique of member paintings, bring a painting with you for a review. This <a href=\"/news/may-monthly-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3692 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-monthly-meetings\" id=\"post-3692\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/april-guest-artist-andrew-kusmin/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"A man wearing a red hat on the beach.\" src=\"/media/archive/8a2db9ccb9d9328f0a456205f21bd30adaea0a34ba1c8f1dfb9a9613ea8f6d51.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/april-guest-artist-andrew-kusmin/\" rel=\"bookmark\">April Guest Artist, Andrew Kusmin</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-04T20:12:16-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 4, 2018, 8:12 pm\">April 4, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists Meeting, April 21, 2018, 2:00p.m., Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich The Guild of Harwich Artists welcomes watercolor artist, Andrew Kusmin, at its meeting on Saturday, April <a href=\"/news/april-guest-artist-andrew-kusmin/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is no